'''Pink''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from the [[Rainbow Box]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
Its blade is hot pink in color, hence the name. The guard is dark magenta, and the handle is solid black.
